  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual entity 'woman' as the speaker of the text 'i don't like the sun so i wear a visor'. The text uses 'i' to directly map the user's perspective onto the woman, making her the embodied subject of the statement. This projection is reinforced by the visual framing, which centers the woman as the focal point of the meme's humor and irony.",
